intro = Snowblind: away from a fire, the cold builds up (Hypothermia). Light the great campfire with firewood from under the trees: it will melt the ice wall to the north.
fire.need = You need firewood to light it.
fire.lit = The great fire catches: the ice wall starts to melt. Keep feeding it!
fire.fed = Firewood added: {fuel} %.
fire.full = The fire is already at its strongest.
fire.out = The great fire went out! Relight it with firewood.
fire.doused = An ice elemental reaches the fire and smothers it!
fire.elementals = Ice elementals come out of the forest: stop them before the fire!
fire.wave = Foes attack the camp!
wall.melted = The ice wall has melted: the road is clear.
wood.taken = Firewood taken ({count}/3).
wood.full = You already carry three bundles of firewood.
torch.taken = Torch taken: light the braziers around the Source.
torch.has = You already have a torch.
brazier.need = You need a torch to light this brazier.
brazier.lit = Brazier lit ({count}/5): the Source's frost shield weakens.
brazier.fed = Brazier fed: {fuel} %.
brazier.wood = You need firewood (from the huts) to feed this brazier.
brazier.full = This brazier already burns at its strongest.
brazier.out = A brazier goes out ({count}/5 lit).
source.enter = The Elemental Source! Light the braziers (torch at the rack): each unlit brazier gives it a stack of frost shield.
source.strike = The Source strikes the braziers!
source.blizzard = Every brazier is out: BLIZZARD! Relight one quickly.
source.calm = A brazier burns: the blizzard dies down.
source.reset = The Source freezes in the ice.
source.victory = The Elemental Source shatters: the forest path opens. Take a torch and follow the tracks.
forest.ambush = Frost cultists burst out between the firs!
shaman.enter = The Legendary Shaman! His sword strikes freeze: stay near the village fires.
shaman.crystals = The Shaman summons three corrupted crystals: he takes no damage while they stand.
shaman.exposed = The crystals are shattered: the Shaman is vulnerable!
shaman.balcony = The Shaman leaps onto his balcony and rains spikes: destroy the Ice Effigy!
shaman.down = The Effigy shatters: the Shaman comes down!
shaman.bear = The Shaman takes his bear form!
shaman.reset = The Shaman withdraws into the blizzard.
shaman.victory = The Legendary Shaman falls: the storm calms.
cold.encased = The cold takes you: you are encased in an ice shard! Your allies must break it.
cold.freed = The ice shard breaks: you are free.
cold.ally = {name} is encased in ice: break the shard!
checkpoint = Respawn point moved.
title.victory = Snowblind complete
